{"packet_id":"EXT-20260418-052939","stage":"segment:enrich","command":["tools/infra/injection_enrich_segment.py","EXT-20260418-052939","--segment-id","S2","--claim","Recent literature shows mixed empirical outcomes: KAN variants can be competitive or superior in some scientific/symbolic settings, but fair benchmarks report MLP often stronger in broad tasks unless KAN bases/parameterization are adapted.","--inference-flag","inference:cross-source","--evidence-url","https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.16674","--evidence-summary","Fairer comparison: MLP generally outperforms KAN except symbolic formula representation.","--evidence-url","https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.07906","--evidence-summary","Irregular/noisy function study: KAN not uniformly best; MLP can match/outperform.","--evidence-url","https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0045782524005462","--evidence-summary","FAIR PDE/operator benchmark: original B-spline KAN lacks efficiency/robustness; modified polynomial KAN more competitive.","--evidence-url","https://www.nature.com/articles/s42256-025-01087-7","--evidence-summary","Domain-specific KAN-GNN success in molecular property prediction indicates strong niche potential.","--mark-creative-complete","--mark-verification-complete"],"result":{"ok":true,"segment_id":"S2"},"extra":{"lock_wait_sec":4.6190034481696784e-06,"mark_creative_complete":true,"mark_verification_complete":true,"evidence_count":4},"at":"2026-04-18T05:30:16+00:00","gpu":{"available":false,"raw":{"cmd":["nvidia-smi","--query-gpu=index,memory.total,memory.used,memory.free","--format=csv,noheader,nounits"],"missing":true}}}
