{"packet_id":"EXT-20260418-054025","stage":"create:research:raw","command":["tools/infra/injection_research_packet.py","--topic","Neural Operators (FNO/DeepONet/PINO) and repo integration for operator-valued ML","--question","Which claims are robust for FNO vs DeepONet vs PINNs (speed, resolution invariance, geometry handling) based on primary sources?","--question","How should InfoGeometry encode neural-operator semantics as owner contracts without vacuous assumptions?","--source-url","https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.08895","--source-url","https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.03193","--source-url","https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.03794","--source-url","https://arxiv.org/abs/2202.11214","--source-url","https://jmlr.org/beta/papers/v24/21-1524.html","--source-url","https://jmlr.org/beta/papers/v24/23-0064.html","--source-url","https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0045782522001207","--source-url","https://deepxde.readthedocs.io/en/stable/demos/operator.html","--source-url","https://github.com/neuraloperator/neuraloperator","--workflow-mode","gemini-hermes-codex","--segment","Validate core claims: function-to-function learning, discretization transfer, and where speedup statements are conditional.","--segment","Compare FNO and DeepONet under geometry complexity, sensorization, and trunk/branch flexibility.","--segment","Map a rigorous Lean owner interface for neural operators onto existing Arnold/NavierStokes bridge lanes.","--lane","raw"],"result":{"ok":true},"extra":{"lock_wait_sec":6.107002263888717e-06,"lane":"raw"},"at":"2026-04-18T05:40:26+00:00","gpu":{"available":false,"raw":{"cmd":["nvidia-smi","--query-gpu=index,memory.total,memory.used,memory.free","--format=csv,noheader,nounits"],"missing":true}}}
{"packet_id":"EXT-20260418-054025","stage":"segment:enrich","command":["tools/infra/injection_enrich_segment.py","EXT-20260418-054025","--segment-id","S1","--claim","Neural operators are function-to-function models; discretization transfer is a central design objective, but practical invariance depends on architecture and training regime rather than being automatic for every operator model.","--inference-flag","inference:cross-source","--evidence-url","https://jmlr.org/beta/papers/v24/21-1524.html","--evidence-summary","Neural Operator framework formalizes operator learning with universal approximation and discretization-invariant parameter sharing in the framework assumptions.","--evidence-url","https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.08895","--evidence-summary","FNO reports zero-shot super-resolution and large speedups on benchmark PDE families.","--evidence-url","https://arxiv.org/abs/2202.11214","--evidence-summary","FourCastNet demonstrates orders-of-magnitude runtime gains in weather forecasting context with AFNO-based stack.","--mark-creative-complete","--mark-verification-complete"],"result":{"ok":true,"segment_id":"S1"},"extra":{"lock_wait_sec":5.686000804416835e-06,"mark_creative_complete":true,"mark_verification_complete":true,"evidence_count":3},"at":"2026-04-18T05:40:34+00:00","gpu":{"available":false,"raw":{"cmd":["nvidia-smi","--query-gpu=index,memory.total,memory.used,memory.free","--format=csv,noheader,nounits"],"missing":true}}}
{"packet_id":"EXT-20260418-054025","stage":"segment:enrich","command":["tools/infra/injection_enrich_segment.py","EXT-20260418-054025","--segment-id","S2","--claim","FNO is highly efficient on regular grids and spectral structure; DeepONet is generally more flexible for irregular geometry/sensor settings. Fair benchmarks show no universal winner; performance is problem-regime dependent.","--inference-flag","inference:cross-source","--evidence-url","https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0045782522001207","--evidence-summary","FAIR benchmark (16 cases) reports comparable performance in simple settings and FNO degradation on complex geometries without extensions; includes enhanced variants for both.","--evidence-url","https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.03193","--evidence-summary","DeepONet architecture (branch/trunk) and operator UAT; flexible sensor-based input encoding.","--evidence-url","https://jmlr.org/beta/papers/v24/23-0064.html","--evidence-summary","Geo-FNO extends FNO to general geometries by learned deformations, addressing baseline FFT-grid limitation.","--mark-creative-complete","--mark-verification-complete"],"result":{"ok":true,"segment_id":"S2"},"extra":{"lock_wait_sec":4.563000402413309e-06,"mark_creative_complete":true,"mark_verification_complete":true,"evidence_count":3},"at":"2026-04-18T05:40:42+00:00","gpu":{"available":false,"raw":{"cmd":["nvidia-smi","--query-gpu=index,memory.total,memory.used,memory.free","--format=csv,noheader,nounits"],"missing":true}}}
